      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Edit 6/15/2023 - 22:55 UTC\n\nAn ideal situation would be to decide on a constant FixedUpdate rate for the client on all devices. Though some systems on VRChat may rely on having the FixedUpdate at the max refresh rate of a device to ensure smooth gameplay and movement. This is why I ask for a new constant update loop instead of changing the current. If it can be done reasonably, set a fixed rate for FixedUpdate for all devices!",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
    {
      "__v": 0,
      "_id": "649202a281114d0972dbfaab",
      "author": {
